Question 7
What is output by the code to the right? 
A)  5 
B)  6 
C)  3 
D)  7 
E)  13 

int a = 6; 
int b = 3; 
char c = 'C'; 
boolean flag = (a & b) > 1; 

int result = (c & 0x0F) |  
        (flag ? a ^ b : a & b); 
out.println(result); 

Question 8
What is output by the code to the right? 
A)  501 99 
B)  500 100 
C)  100 
D)  501 
E)  501 100 
int x = 100; 
int y = 500; 

if (x > 'a' | y++ < 501) { 
    out.println(y); 
} 
if (-x-- > ~x) { 
    out.println(x); 
} 

Question 9
What is output by the code to the right? 
A)  10 
B)  12 
C)  0 
D)  There is no output due to a runtime error. 
E)  There is no output due to a compile time error. 

for (int i = -1, total = 0; i < 19; i+=3) { 
    int x = i / (i % 7); 
    total += i; 
} 
out.println(total); 

